{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-6674e52ce5ac","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-6674e52ce5ac","name":"草莓酱","category":"condiment","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/condiment/%E8%8D%89%E8%8E%93%E9%85%B1/%E8%8D%89%E8%8E%93%E9%85%B1.md","blob_sha":"fdab957e3fd8ccba59048411f80397eb64f76568","details":{"introduction":"这是一道酸甜可口、果香浓郁的家常果酱，非常适合涂抹面包。草莓富含维生素 C，不过熬煮时糖分较高，可依口味调整。做法非常简单，新手也能轻松搞定，从准备到熬好大约需要两个小时。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 草莓\n- 白砂糖\n- 保鲜膜"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 草莓 1200 克\n- 白糖 400 克 （如需要低糖饮食，可以考虑降低到 200g）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 草莓洗净去叶\n2. 将草莓切碎放入合适的碗中\n3. 将白糖倒入碗中与草莓搅拌均匀\n4. 碗用保鲜膜覆盖静置 1 小时\n5. 将静置的草莓和糖的混合物倒入不粘锅中开大火烧开\n6. 烧开后转小火不断搅拌直至果酱呈粘稠状关火\n7. 待草莓酱冷却后装入准备好的密封罐中"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：草莓500g、白砂糖150g、柠檬汁15g；整份约450g。熬煮后果肉全部食用，不额外过滤弃料。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":165.288889,"protein_g":0.756111,"carbohydrate_g":42.096667,"fat_g":0.341333},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/167762/nutrients","version":"9811dca62d669719","fdc_ids":[167762,169655,167747]},"profile_id":"family-6674e52ce5ac-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-6674e52ce5ac","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-6674e52ce5ac","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-6674e52ce5ac-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"strawberry","grams":500},{"key":"sugar","grams":150},{"key":"lemon_juice","grams":15}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"9811dca62d669719","com